<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">DeReason: A
Difficulty-Aware Curriculum Improves Decoupled SFT-then-RL Training for
General Reasoning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Hanxu Hu
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>University of Zurich
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
